jobs.description:
Are you detail-oriented and enjoy working with your hands? Do you want to be part of a global leader in logistics? Then DHL Weert is looking for you!

As a VAS Employee at DHL, you'll be responsible for performing various value-added services such as labeling, repacking, assembling promotional packages, and quality control. Your work ensures that every product leaving our warehouse meets customer-specific requirements — adding that extra touch of value that sets DHL apart.

- You are fulltime available;
- You enjoy hands-on, repetitive work and have a strong eye for detail;
- You are able to work independently and follow clear instructions;
- You have basic knowledge of English;
- Experience in logistics is a plus — but not required!

Are you an organized individual who excels at creating an efficient, welcoming, and well-structured work environment? If so, this role might be just what you’re looking for! As an office manager you’ll be at the heart of the operations of the Amsterdam office. Your role will involve ensuring everything runs smoothly, from overseeing breakfast and snacks to managing office supplies and welcoming visitors. Your primary goal is to maintain a pleasant and productive atmosphere for the team. Your main respsonsibilities are:  - ordering and managing office supplies, breakfast items, snacks, and flowers, so keeping the office well-stocked and organized;
 - managing maintenance, repairs, and liaising with suppliers;
 - handling incoming and outgoing mail and general office communication;
 - welcoming guests and visitors, assisting with new employee onboarding and setting up meeting rooms;
 - helping with the planning and execution of office events and celebrations.

 The workinghours are every weekday from 8:30 till 12:30. This is a temporary position. 
Wij bieden
  - A dynamic, diverse role within a growing company;
 - A friendly, informal work culture with supportive colleagues;
 - Everyday a free lunch from a chef!
 - A hour salary of € 24,00.



 - Is proactive, detail-oriented and hands-on in approach;
 - Communicates well, isapproachable and can effectively prioritize tasks;
 - Has previous experience in a similar role and thrive in a fast-paced work environment;
 - Speaks fluent English and has at least B2 level Dutch;
 - Is passionate about maintaining a positive and efficient workspace.
